faqs:
  - q: "How long does it take to deploy an AI workforce?"
    a: "Most teams are fully deployed within 2-4 weeks. We start with Winchester (Chief of Staff) and layer in additional bots based on your priorities. By week 4, your entire AI team is operational and learning your business patterns."
  - q: "Will the AI bots make mistakes or send wrong emails?"
    a: "All bots operate with human-in-the-loop safeguards during the first 30 days. Winchester drafts emails for your approval before sending. After the training period, bots handle routine communications autonomously while flagging anything unusual for your review."
  - q: "Can I customize what each bot does?"
    a: "Absolutely. Every bot is configured specifically for your business. Winchester learns your email patterns, Victoria builds reports from your actual data, and Marcus tracks your specific compliance requirements. No two deployments are identical."
  - q: "What happens if something goes wrong at 2 AM?"
    a: "That's the point — your AI workforce handles it. Winchester triages urgent items and escalates only what truly needs your attention. You wake up to a prioritized briefing, not a crisis. We also provide 24/7 support for the first 90 days."
  - q: "How does pricing work? Are there hidden fees?"
    a: "Pricing is straightforward monthly subscriptions. Starter is $4,997/mo for 3 bots, Professional is $8,997/mo for 5 bots, and Elite is $14,997/mo for the full team plus custom solutions. No setup fees, no per-email charges, no surprises."
  - q: "What if I already have a CRM or project management tool?"
    a: "Our bots integrate with your existing stack — Salesforce, HubSpot, Monday.com, Slack, Gmail, Outlook, and dozens more. Sophia Operations specializes in connecting your tools so nothing falls through the cracks."
